.TH PSVocabularyAdd 3 2023-12-07 "PsyC 0.9.3" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
PSVocabularyAdd

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/dataset.h>

.I
int64_t  
.br
\fBPSVocabularyAdd\fR(\fIPSVocabulary *vocabulary\fR, \fIchar *token\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add token \fItoken\fR to \fIvocabulary\fR. The token is added to the internal dictionary of \fIvocabulary\fR and a numeric index (ID) is assigned to it.
.br
The index is a progressive number. If the token already exists, the internal dictionary won't be updated and the token's numeric value (id) is immediately returned.  

.SH RETURN VALUES
The numeric index (ID) of the token. If token could not be added to the dictionary or \fItoken\fR is \fINULL\fR, the function will return \fIPS_INVALID_TOKEN_ID\fR.
